sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Mobile Client
    participant G as Google OAuth
    participant A as MyVanitys API

    C->>G: Redirect user to Google consent screen
    G-->>C: Redirect back with authorization code
    C->>A: POST /auth/register  { authProvider, authCode, registrationDate? }
    A->>G: Exchange authorization code for tokens + profile
    G-->>A: Profile (Google id, email, name)

    alt Google account already registered
        A-->>C: 409 ProblemDetail (User Already Exists)
        Note over C: Route the user to login instead.
    else New account
        A-->>C: 200 UserCreatedResponse  { userId }
        Note over C,A: No token is returned. Call POST /auth/google to get a JWT.
    end
